"# Wix Studio Showcase — Design Blueprints, Typography, Color Palettes & Component Library\n\nThis document contains deep design extraction, architectural specifications, color schemes, typography hierarchies, and self-contained zero-dependency interactive component blueprints for three Wix Studio templates:\n1. **Dentist / Healthcare Clinic (\"me.aid\")** — Template 3419 (`https://www.wix.com/demone2/meaid`)\n2. **Trucking / Freight Logistics (\"T.ROAD\")** — Template 3623 (`https://www.wix.com/demone2/t-road`)\n3. **Fast Food / Casual Dining (\"Chix Kitchen\")** — Template 3498 (`https://www.wix.com/demone2/chix-kitchen`)\n\n---\n\n## Executive Comparison Matrix\n\n| Specification | 1. me.aid (Healthcare) | 2. T.ROAD (Trucking & Logistics) | 3. Chix Kitchen (Fast Food) |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Wix ID / Demo** | 3419 / `demone2/meaid` | 3623 / `demone2/t-road` | 3498 / `demone2/chix-kitchen` |\n| **Aesthetic Archetype** | Editorial Serenity & Clinical Calm | Industrial Brutalism & Freight Power | Retro Pop Diner & Fast-Casual Nostalgia |\n| **Primary Background** | Soft Celadon / Mint (`#DDFFDA`) | Asphalt Black (`#0D0D11`) / White (`#FFFFFF`) | Warm Custard / Butter Yellow (`#FFE39B`) |\n| **Primary Text / Headings** | Deep Slate Charcoal (`#2E3434`) | Industrial Steel (`#323232`) & White | Deep Chili Crimson (`#762420`) |\n| **Accent Colors** | Pure White (`#FFFFFF`) | High-Vis Caution Amber (`#F59E0B`) | Sauce Pepper Red (`#B13630`) & Burgundy (`#3D1311`) |\n| **Corner Geometry** | Organic Pill (`500px` rounded-full) | Razor Sharp (`0px` strict brutalism) | Funky Pill (`60px` to `88px` rounded-full) |\n| **Display Typography** | `Plus Jakarta Sans` / `Madefor Text` | `DIN Neuzeit Grotesk` / `Barlow Condensed` | `Syne, sans-serif` (Bold 700 & 800) |\n| **Hero Headline Scale** | 75px - 168px (Normal tracking) | 236.5px (Condensed, `-11.8px` tracking) | 105.58px (Syne 700, `1.0` line-height) |\n| **Signature Micro-Detail** | Giant 372px background watermark | 01-06 Monospace numbered logistics grid | Continuous infinite CSS marquee banners |\n| **Interactive Component** | Patient Appointment & Consultation Form | Freight Route Calculator & Quote Form | Online Food Menu with Dietary Badges & Cart |\n\n---\n\n## 1. Template 1: me.aid — Home Health Care / Dentist / Medical Clinic\n\n### 1.1 Aesthetic & Visual Philosophy\n- **Core Mood:** High-trust, serene, human-first medical care. Replaces stereotypical sterile hospital blue with warm, organic, editorial celadon green and grounding charcoal slate.\n- **Visual Harmony:** Ultra-clean layout with huge generous whitespace, soft contrast, and massive editorial typographic scales that convey authority and calm confidence.\n\n### 1.2 Color Palette\n- **Background Base:** `#DDFFDA` (`rgb(221, 255, 218)`) — Soft Celadon / Pastel Mint Green\n- **Contrast Typography:** `#2E3434` (`rgb(46, 52, 52)`) — Deep Slate Charcoal / Greenish-Black\n- **Muted Body / Secondary:** `rgba(46, 52, 52, 0.70)`\n- **Surface Card White:** `#FFFFFF`\n- **Subtle Dividers & Borders:** `rgba(46, 52, 52, 0.15)`\n- **Primary CTA Button:** Background `#2E3434`, Text `#DDFFDA`, Border `0px`, Border Radius `500px` (Pill)\n- **Secondary CTA Button:** Background `#DDFFDA`, Text `#2E3434`, Border `1px solid #2E3434`, Border Radius `500px`\n\n### 1.3 Typography Hierarchy\n- **Primary Display Font:** `Plus Jakarta Sans, -apple-system, sans-serif` (or `Wix Madefor Text`)\n- **Hero Headline (H1):** `75px` (mobile `42px`, desktop display up to `168px`), `font-weight: 400`, `line-height: 1.1`, `letter-spacing: normal`. Text: *\"Caring for you is our priority\"*\n- **Hero Subtitle:** `24px`, `font-weight: 400`, line-height `1.5`. Text: *\"Personalized care, right at home. The trusted home health choice for you.\"*\n- **Giant Watermark Logo:** `372px`, opacity `0.06`, absolute positioned behind hero content: *\"me.aid\"*\n- **Section Headings (H2):** `28px` to `56px`, `font-weight: 400`, color `#2E3434`.\n- **Services Editorial List Items:** `95px` (desktop) / `44px` (mobile), `font-weight: 400`.\n- **Body & Subhead Copy:** `18px` to `20px`, `line-height: 1.6`, color `#2E3434`.\n\n### 1.4 Section Architecture & Interactive Layouts\n1. **Floating Pill Navigation Dock:**\n   - Brand: Typographic logo `me.aid` (distinct period dot accent).\n   - Links: About, Our services, Our team, Reviews, Contact.\n   - Action Button: `Get in touch` (pill button, `border-radius: 500px`).\n2. **Asymmetric Hero Section:**\n   - Left-aligned high-impact headline and narrative kicker.\n   - Primary Pill CTA: `Contact us` with subtle hover scale (`scale(1.02)`).\n   - Giant low-contrast background watermark (`me.aid`).\n3. **About Section (Editorial Two-Column):**\n   - Left Column: Section label + H2 *\"About us / Our commitment to home health care\"*.\n   - Right Column: Mission statement and patient-centered values.\n4. **Services Showcase (Large Typographic List):**\n   - 6 Core Medical Services rendered as large editorial headings:\n     1. Physical therapy\n     2. Skilled nursing care\n     3. Hospice care\n     4. After surgery care\n     5. Speech Therapy\n     6. Nutrition counseling\n   - Hover Behavior: Element text shifts right (`translateX(12px)`), subtle underline or pill tag reveals specialty details.\n5. **Benefits at a Glance (3-Column Grid):**\n   - Column 1: *\"Cost-effective\"* — Transparent pricing, zero hidden clinic surcharges.\n   - Column 2: *\"Skilled care\"* — Board-certified licensed nurses and therapists.\n   - Column 3: *\"Comfort\"* — Treatment delivered safely in familiar surroundings.\n6. **Medical Team Grid (6 Specialists):**\n   - Dr. Talya Sulami — Head of clinic\n   - Dr. Tom Chie — Family doctor\n   - George Mekler — Therapist\n   - Elinor Jonas — Speech therapist\n   - Lee Levin — Hospice nurse\n   - Shaya Raviv — Nutritionist\n   - Card layout: Minimalist portrait placeholder, doctor name, and specialty pill badge.\n7. **Patient Testimonials:**\n   - Clean quotes with patient attribution: Eden Rachim, Naya Denner, Lenny Yliuay.\n8. **Interactive Patient Consultation & Booking Form:**\n   - Fields: First Name (required), Last Name (required), Email (required), Phone (with international country picker), \"How Can We Help You?\" (multi-line textarea).\n   - Submit: `Submit` pill button with instantaneous inline validation and toast confirmation.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Template 2: T.ROAD — Trucking & Freight Logistics\n\n### 2.1 Aesthetic & Visual Philosophy\n- **Core Mood:** Commercial freight heavyweight, industrial durability, uncompromising reliability.\n- **Visual Harmony:** Brutalist structure, high-contrast monochrome with industrial safety amber accents, razor-sharp `0px` border-radius, and massive condensed typography that echoes roadside signage and heavy-duty shipping containers.\n\n### 2.2 Color Palette\n- **Void Asphalt:** `#0D0D11` (`rgb(13, 13, 17)`)\n- **Industrial Steel Charcoal:** `#323232` (`rgb(50, 50, 50)`)\n- **Highway Pure White:** `#FFFFFF`\n- **Concrete Surface Gray:** `#1A1D24` / `#F4F4F6`\n- **High-Vis Safety Amber (Accent):** `#F59E0B` (`rgb(245, 158, 11)`)\n- **Heavy Industrial Borders:** `1px solid #323232` or `1px solid #FFFFFF` (strict `0px` radius)\n- **Primary CTA Button:** Background `#323232`, Text `#FFFFFF`, `0px` border-radius, `1px solid #323232`.\n- **Secondary CTA Button:** Background `transparent`, Text `#FFFFFF`, `0px` border-radius, `1px solid #FFFFFF`.\n\n### 2.3 Typography Hierarchy\n- **Headline / Display Font:** `DIN Neuzeit Grotesk` (or `Barlow Condensed`, `Oswald`, `Druk Wide`), all-caps condensed grotesque.\n- **UI / Body / Subhead Font:** `Sora, sans-serif` (modern geometric clarity).\n- **Giant Hero Scale:** `236.5px` (responsive scale down to `56px` on mobile), line-height `236.5px`, `letter-spacing: -11.8px` (`-0.05em`), all-caps. Text: *\"TRUCKING SERVICES / ALWAYS ON-TIME\"*\n- **Subhead & Kicker:** `18px`, uppercase, `letter-spacing: 0.04em`. Text: *\"LOCAL, REGIONAL, AND NATIONWIDE TRANSPORTATION SERVICES\"*\n- **Section Headings (H2):** `56px` all-caps, `letter-spacing: -0.56px`, `DIN Neuzeit Grotesk`.\n- **Body Text:** `16px`, `line-height: 1.6`, `Sora, sans-serif`.\n\n### 2.4 Section Architecture & Interactive Layouts\n1. **Industrial Top Bar:**\n   - Nav items: `About`, `Fleet`, `Services`.\n   - Brand: Centered bold `T.ROAD` in DIN Neuzeit Grotesk.\n   - Action: Sharp rectangular button `GET A QUOTE`.\n2. **Massive Hero Banner:**\n   - Full-bleed heavy transport truck on highway backdrop.\n   - Giant 236px headline with tight negative tracking.\n   - Dual sharp buttons: `CONTACT US` (outlined) and `GET A QUOTE` (solid).\n3. **Heritage Brand Story:**\n   - *\"OUR JOURNEY, YOUR DESTINATION\"* / *\"TRUSTED TRANSPORTATION SOLUTIONS SINCE 2002.\"*\n   - Giant background watermark `T.ROAD`.\n4. **Mighty Fleet Gallery:**\n   - 4 Commercial Equipment Cards:\n     - Semi-Tractor (Class 8 Long-Haul)\n     - 53ft Dry Van (Local & Regional)\n     - Flatbed Transport (Oversized & Construction)\n     - Temperature-Controlled Reefer (-20°F to 65°F)\n   - Interactive specification toggle displaying payload capacity, cubic volume, and axle config.\n5. **Numbered 6-Part Logistics Grid:**\n   - `01 LONG-HAUL TRUCKING`\n   - `02 SHORT-HAUL TRANSPORTATION`\n   - `03 TEMPERATURE-CONTROLLED TRANSPORT`\n   - `04 LOGISTICS AND SUPPLY CHAIN MANAGEMENT`\n   - `05 FLATBED TRUCKING SERVICES`\n   - `06 FULL TRUCKLOAD (FTL)`\n6. **Client Endorsements & 5-Star Badges:**\n   - Testimonials from logistics directors (Danielle Yliuay) with 5-star graphic rating.\n7. **Interactive Freight Quote & Route Calculator (\"LET'S GET MOVING\"):**\n   - Inputs: Shipper Name, Company, Phone (with country code dropdown), Work Email, Freight Details.\n   - Live Quote Engine: Distance (miles) & Tonnage slider that estimates freight cost in real time.\n   - Submit: `GET A QUOTE TODAY` sharp industrial CTA.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Template 3: Chix Kitchen — Fast Casual & Fast Food Restaurant\n\n### 3.1 Aesthetic & Visual Philosophy\n- **Core Mood:** High-energy retro diner, mouth-watering indulgence, punchy pop typography, playful fast-casual excitement.\n- **Visual Harmony:** Deep chili red paired with rich butter custard yellow, bold curved `Syne` typography, continuous infinite horizontal marquee tickers, and frictionless one-click ordering.\n\n### 3.2 Color Palette\n- **Warm Custard / Butter Yellow:** `#FFE39B` (`rgb(255, 227, 155)`)\n- **Deep Chili Rust / Crimson Red:** `#762420` (`rgb(118, 36, 32)`)\n- **Vivid Pepper Sauce Red:** `#B13630` (`rgb(177, 54, 48)`)\n- **Burgundy Mahogany Base:** `#3D1311` (`rgb(61, 19, 17)`)\n- **Pure White / Cream:** `#FFFFFF`\n- **Primary CTA Button:** Background `#FFE39B`, Text `#B13630`, Border `0px`, Border Radius `60px` to `88px` (Pill).\n- **Secondary CTA Button:** Background `transparent`, Text `#762420`, Border `1px solid #762420`, Border Radius `60px`.\n\n### 3.3 Typography Hierarchy\n- **Display / Brand / Heading Font:** `Syne, sans-serif` (weights 700 and 800, distinctive rounded grotesque with wide letterforms).\n- **Body & Menu Description Font:** `Wix Madefor Text` / `Plus Jakarta Sans, sans-serif`.\n- **Hero Headline Scale:** `105.58px` (mobile `48px`), `line-height: 105.58px`, `font-weight: 700`, all-caps. Text: *\"THE CRISPY CLASSIC FRIED CHICKEN IS BACK!\"*\n- **Section Headings (H2):** `80px` uppercase Syne (*\"The Menu\"*, *\"Hot And Tender Right At Your Door\"*, *\"Yummy Confessions\"*).\n- **Continuous Marquee Tickers:** `22px` to `26px` Syne bold all-caps with generous spacing.\n- **Menu Item Titles & Prices:** `20px` - `24px` Syne bold.\n\n### 3.4 Section Architecture & Interactive Layouts\n1. **Continuous Infinite Marquee Tickers:**\n   - Marquee 1 (Header): `Get The Chix Fix! • Get The Chix Fix! • Get The Chix Fix!`\n   - Marquee 2 (Mid-Page): `Crispy Dream • Crispy Dream • Crispy Dream`\n   - Marquee 3 (Footer): `Order Online! • Order Online! • Order Online!`\n   - Interactive Control: Play/Pause button that pauses the CSS keyframe scroll.\n2. **Top Navigation with Floating Cart Counter:**\n   - Brand: `Chix Kitchen` in Syne 26px bold.\n   - Nav links: `Menu` (`/menus`), `Order Online` (`/order-online`).\n   - Floating Cart Pill: `Cart with 0 items` that tracks order count in real-time.\n3. **Hero Section:**\n   - 105px high-energy headline in custard yellow over burgundy.\n   - Pill CTA button `Order Online` in vibrant red.\n   - Golden fried chicken hero imagery with floating flavor badges (*\"Extra Crispy\"*, *\"Secret 11 Spices\"*).\n4. **Food Menu Showcase with Dietary Badges:**\n   - **Chix Mains:**\n     - Honey BBQ Chicken Tenders (6pc) — $10.00\n     - Crispy Chicken Salad — $10.00\n     - Nashville Hot Garlic Wings (3pc) — $11.00 `[Mild 🌶️]`\n     - Honey BBQ Drumstick (3pc) — $11.00 `[Dairy free 🥛🚫]`\n     - Crispy Classic Drumstick (3pc) — $11.00\n     - Crispy Classic Sandwich — $12.00\n     - Buffalo Crispy Mix (9 pc) — $14.00 `[Dairy free 🥛🚫]`\n   - **Chix Sides:**\n     - Cole Slaw — $4.00 `[Dairy free 🥛🚫]`\n     - Green Beans — $4.00 `[Vegetarian 🌿]`\n     - Crinkle-Cut Fries — $4.50 `[Dairy free 🥛🚫]`\n     - Cheesy Loaded Fries — $5.00\n     - 4-Cheese Mac and Cheese — $4.50\n     - Southern Mashed Potatoes — $4.50\n5. **Interactive Food Customization & Slide-Out Cart Drawer:**\n   - Spice level selector: Mild, Nashville Hot, Extra Crispy, Nuclear Fire.\n   - Sauce dips picker: Honey BBQ, Homemade Ranch, Garlic Aioli, Blue Cheese.\n   - Live order counter + slide-out drawer cart with itemized list and tax/subtotal calculation.\n6. **\"Yummy Confessions\" Testimonial Carousel:**\n   - 5-Star customer review cards (Bonnie M.) with next/prev pagination.\n7. **Instagram Community 6-Grid:**\n   - Branded photo gallery showing crispy chicken closeups and customer unboxings.\n8. **Hours & Location Footer:**\n   - Mon - Sun: 11AM - 00AM, 500 Terry Francine Street, San Francisco, CA.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Reusable Zero-Dependency Code Implementations\n\n### 4.1 Snippet: The Celadon / Slate Healthcare Clinic Component (me.aid)\n```html\n<!-- me.aid Lightweight Zero-Dependency Component -->\n<section style=\"background-color: #DDFFDA; color: #2E3434; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', system-ui, sans-serif; padding: 60px 24px; min-height: 100vh; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\">\n  <!-- Watermark Logo -->\n  <div style=\"position: absolute; right: -50px; top: 10%; font-size: clamp(120px, 20vw, 360px); font-weight: 700; color: rgba(46, 52, 52, 0.05); pointer-events: none; user-select: none;\">\n    me.aid\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Floating Nav Pill -->\n  <nav style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto 60px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); border-radius: 500px; padding: 10px 24px; border: 1px solid rgba(46, 52, 52, 0.1);\">\n    <a href=\"#\" style=\"font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; color: #2E3434; letter-spacing: -0.02em;\">me<span style=\"color: #10B981;\">.</span>aid</a>\n    <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 20px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500;\">\n      <a href=\"#about\" style=\"text-decoration: none; color: #2E3434;\">About</a>\n      <a href=\"#services\" style=\"text-decoration: none; color: #2E3434;\">Services</a>\n      <a href=\"#team\" style=\"text-decoration: none; color: #2E3434;\">Team</a>\n    </div>\n    <a href=\"#contact\" style=\"background: #2E3434; color: #DDFFDA; padding: 8px 18px; border-radius: 500px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;\">Get in touch</a>\n  </nav>\n\n  <!-- Hero Content -->\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; position: relative; z-index: 1;\">\n    <span style=\"display: inline-block; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #2E3434; margin-bottom: 12px; background: rgba(46,52,52,0.08); padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 500px;\">\n      Home Health Care Clinic\n    </span>\n    <h1 style=\"font-size: clamp(38px, 6vw, 75px); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.1; margin: 0 0 20px; color: #2E3434; letter-spacing: -0.03em;\">\n      Caring for you is our priority\n    </h1>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.5; color: rgba(46, 52, 52, 0.8); max-width: 580px; margin: 0 0 32px;\">\n      Personalized care, right at home. The trusted home health choice for you and your loved ones.\n    </p>\n    <a href=\"#contact\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #2E3434; color: #DDFFDA; padding: 14px 32px; border-radius: 500px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; transition: transform 0.2s;\">\n      Contact us →\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n```\n\n### 4.2 Snippet: The T.ROAD Heavy Industrial Freight Route Calculator\n```html\n<!-- T.ROAD Industrial Route Calculator -->\n<section style=\"background-color: #0D0D11; color: #FFFFFF; font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; padding: 70px 24px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; border: 1px solid #323232; padding: 40px; background: #121318;\">\n    <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; margin-bottom: 30px; border-bottom: 1px solid #323232; padding-bottom: 20px;\">\n      <div>\n        <span style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #F59E0B; letter-spacing: 0.15em;\">04 // INSTANT LOGISTICS ENGINE</span>\n        <h2 style=\"font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-size: 44px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 8px 0 0; letter-spacing: -0.02em;\">LET'S GET MOVING</h2>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: 13px; color: #888;\">24/7 NATIONWIDE DISPATCH</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Live Calculator Controls -->\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n      <div>\n        <label style=\"display: block; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #AAA; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Haul Distance (Miles): <span id=\"dist-val\" style=\"color: #FFF; font-weight: 700;\">450 mi</span></label>\n        <input type=\"range\" id=\"dist-input\" min=\"50\" max=\"2500\" step=\"25\" value=\"450\" style=\"width: 100%; accent-color: #F59E0B;\" oninput=\"updateFreightQuote()\">\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <label style=\"display: block; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #AAA; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Cargo Weight (Tons): <span id=\"ton-val\" style=\"color: #FFF; font-weight: 700;\">12 Tons</span></label>\n        <input type=\"range\" id=\"ton-input\" min=\"1\" max=\"25\" step=\"1\" value=\"12\" style=\"width: 100%; accent-color: #F59E0B;\" oninput=\"updateFreightQuote()\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Live Price Display -->\n    <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; background: #000; border: 1px solid #323232; padding: 20px 24px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n      <div>\n        <span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #888; text-transform: uppercase;\">Estimated Commercial Freight Rate</span>\n        <div id=\"price-display\" style=\"font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-size: 36px; color: #F59E0B; font-weight: 700;\">$1,385 USD</div>\n      </div>\n      <button style=\"background: #323232; color: #FFF; border: 1px solid #FFF; padding: 14px 28px; font-size: 14px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; border-radius: 0;\">\n        LOCK RATE TODAY\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<script>\nfunction updateFreightQuote() {\n  const dist = parseInt(document.getElementById('dist-input').value);\n  const tons = parseInt(document.getElementById('ton-input').value);\n  document.getElementById('dist-val').innerText = dist + ' mi';\n  document.getElementById('ton-val').innerText = tons + ' Tons';\n  const baseRate = 250;\n  const ratePerMile = 2.15;\n  const tonSurcharge = tons * 28;\n  const total = Math.round(baseRate + (dist * ratePerMile) + tonSurcharge);\n  document.getElementById('price-display').innerText = '$' + total.toLocaleString() + ' USD';\n}\n</script>\n```\n\n### 4.3 Snippet: The Chix Kitchen Continuous CSS Marquee & Food Cart\n```html\n<!-- Chix Kitchen Continuous CSS Marquee Banner -->\n<div style=\"background: #762420; color: #FFE39B; overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap; padding: 14px 0; border-top: 2px solid #FFE39B; border-bottom: 2px solid #FFE39B;\">\n  <div style=\"display: inline-block; animation: marquee-scroll 18s linear infinite; font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;\">\n    GET THE CHIX FIX! &nbsp;★&nbsp; CRISPY CLASSIC FRIED CHICKEN &nbsp;★&nbsp; NASHVILLE HOT GARLIC WINGS &nbsp;★&nbsp; ORDER ONLINE TODAY! &nbsp;★&nbsp; GET THE CHIX FIX! &nbsp;★&nbsp; CRISPY CLASSIC FRIED CHICKEN &nbsp;★&nbsp; \n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n@keyframes marquee-scroll {\n  0% { transform: translateX(0); }\n  100% { transform: translateX(-50%); }\n}\n</style>\n```\n\n---\n\n## 5. Architectural Recommendations for Convertix Studio\n\n1. **Lightweight Asset Pipeline:**\n   - Zero bulky external frameworks (replaces Wix Thunderbolt 2MB+ overhead with standard vanilla HTML5/CSS3).\n   - Use Google Fonts with display swap: `Plus Jakarta Sans` (me.aid), `Sora` + `Oswald` (T.ROAD), and `Syne` (Chix Kitchen).\n2. **Interactive Component Architecture:**\n   - Reusable modular components matching the design blueprints.\n   - Built-in instant feedback calculators and micro-state management.\n3. **Sub-second Cold Starts:**\n   - Critical path CSS inlined.\n   - 99+ PageSpeed scores on mobile and desktop devices.\n"